### Current protected V2 example. Supply a real OAuth-issued token locally.
@base = http://localhost:8080
@accessToken = REPLACE_LOCALLY_DO_NOT_COMMIT

### Production readiness; not an OAuth/AI E2E check.
GET {{base}}/actuator/health/readiness

### Current authenticated principal.
GET {{base}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### User-owned units.
GET {{base}}/api/v2/me/units
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Public listings.
GET {{base}}/api/v2/listings?page=0&size=20

### See docs/frontend-api-contract.md for upload-session and four-photo analysis.
